# Copy to .env (git-ignored). Everything here is optional.
#
# Pin the planner to one project folder (docs/adr/0012-project-folder.md). Without it the planner
# shows a start screen and remembers the open project in ~/.config/tattoo-planner/config.json.
# When set, it wins and switching projects in the planner is off. An older data folder (manifest.yaml,
# no project.yaml) still works; `npm run migrate` moves the repo's config/ into it.
# Absolute path or ~/...; quotes are needed when the path contains spaces.
# macOS example (SeaDrive): TATTOO_DATA_DIR="~/Your Secure Cloud/<library>/tattoo-planner-data"
TATTOO_DATA_DIR=

# Port of `npm run serve` (default 4322; 0 = any free port).
# TATTOO_PORT=4322

# Optional, generative edits and new images in the Image studio (docs/adr/0008-generative-edits.md).
# Key from platform.openai.com. The built-in operations need no key.
# TATTOO_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-...
# TATTOO_OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-image-2.5-sunburst   or gpt-image-2.5-flare (faster)
# TATTOO_OPENAI_FIDELITY=high                  high | low | default (leave the field out)
# TATTOO_OPENAI_QUALITY=high                   high | medium | low | auto
# TATTOO_OPENAI_PAD=on                         on | off (off: send images as they are, size auto)
